{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John Meets Sandra"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Sandra: A Corporate Trainer "}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Describing People"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you describe people's appearance and personality, you use adjectives."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use adjectives to describe someone's hair, they go in a particular order.<br/> Start with:<br/>I/You have ...<br/>He/She's got ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Order of Adjectives</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Length\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Style\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Color\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"long\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"curly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brown\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hair\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"short\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"wavy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"blonde\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hair\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"medium\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"straight\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"black\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hair\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">These are adjectives you can use when you talk about someone's personality.</span><br/> cheerful, friendly, outgoing, kind, sweet, thoughtful, generous, quiet, moody, shy, mean<br/><br/>You use the structure<br/><br/>She/He is ...<br/>You/They are ..."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She's tall and slender. She's got long, curly, brown hair. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He's outgoing, kind and thoughtful."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Past Tense & Past Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished.<br/>You use the Past Continuous tense to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br/> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.<br/> Irregular verbs change in different ways.<br/> For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did</span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask ... ?</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do</span>.<br/><br/>For Past Continuous, we add was/were + verb\u201cing\u201d to verbs.<br/>Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add \u201cing\u201d."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were talking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walk\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were walking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"focus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"focused\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were focusing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lead\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"led\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were leading\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"return\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"returned\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were returning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were having\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "When she walked by my office, I was talking on the phone."}, {"type": "example", "content": "When she was talking, I just focused on her face. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "When she had free time, I was leading a tour. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "When I returned from the tour, she was having dinner."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to confess"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to tell a secret truth to someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to confess I really like Sandra."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to describe someone."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be attracted to"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have an interest or romantic feeling towards someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am attracted to Sandra's brown eyes and long hair."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "presenter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person who makes a presentation in front of a group"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sandra was the presenter of the workshop."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "conversation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a talk you have with someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to have a longer conversation with her."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hazel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a light green-brown color"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She has beautiful hazel eyes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "height"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the measure of how high something or someone is"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She is the same height as I am."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "glossy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes a shiny smooth look"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like her full glossy lips."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le07ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of someone you're attracted to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "List, then describe their physical features and personality."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short e-mail to a friend describing what the person looks like and what their personality is like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say how you feel about them."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about someone I'm attracted to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe someone's physical features and personality."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write an e-mail to a friend describing my feelings."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le07ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le07ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"italic\">On March 4, at 9:10 PM, John Harris &#60;John.Harris@mail.com&#62; wrote:</span><br>\nHi, Peter. I have to confess I'm attracted to Sandra, the lovely presenter for that professional development workshop. She works as the Director of Operations for U.S. Tours on the ship.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le07ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "The presentation was helpful, but when she was talking, I was just focusing on her face. She has long straight brown hair and nice hazel eyes. She has full glossy lips, a slender face and a beautiful smile. She's slim and about my height. She seems really friendly, too.", "id": 2, "time": "12400", "image": "engenn5le07ob05re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "When she walked by my office yesterday, I was talking on the phone. Then when she had free time, I was leading a tour. By the time I returned, she had a business dinner. I will try to have a longer conversation with her sometime.", "id": 3, "time": "32000", "image": "engenn5le07ob05re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn5le07ob05re5aud01"}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "